  "title": "Namaz-e-Wahshat (Namaz for the Night of Burial)",
  "data": "Namaz-e-Wahshat\nThe prayer to be offered at the burial night consists of two units.\nIn the first unit, [Surah al-Faatehah](A5) and Ayah al-Kursi are recited.\nIn the second unit, [Surah al-Faatehah](A5) is recited one time and [Surah al-Qadr](A101) repeated ten times.\nWhen you say the Taslim statement, you may say the following supplication:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّابْعَثْ ثَوَابَهَا اِلٰى قَبْرِ ۔۔۔\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADINW WAB A'S SAWAABAHAA ELAA QABRE...\nO Allah, bless Muhammad and the family of Muhammad and send its reward to the grave of...",
  "tabs": [
    "Namaz Instead of Almsgiving\nIf you do not have anything to give as alms, you may offer a two-unit prayer, reciting [Surah al-Faatehah](A5) once and [Surah al-Tawheed](A116) twice in the first unit and [Surah al-Faatehah](A5) once and [Surah al-Takathur](A106) ten times in the second unit.\nWhen you accomplish the prayer (by uttering the Taslim statement), you may say the following:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّابْعَثْ ثَوَابَهَا اِلٰى قَبْرِ ذٰلِكَ الْمَيِّتِ۔۔۔\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADINW WAB A'S SAWAABAHAA ELAA QABRE ZAALEKAL MAYYETE...\nO Allah, bless Muhammad and the family of Muhammad, and send its reward to the grave of that deceased person..."
